          "response": "Hey, you've killed %u goblins, right? Looks like you hate them as much as I do. Come with me in the back of the store, I've got something to show you that might be useful. Look at this beautiful sword, it's a Goblin Slayer sword. It has the uncanny ability of literally destroying goblins. It's yours if you're willing to pay the fair price of 25000 gold pieces. Does that sound fair to you?",
